# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:243
translate chinese damanhur_march_day1_fdb1fc10:

    "{cps=50}穿越沙漠的艰苦跋涉，很快耗尽了你的气力。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}疲劳增加！"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:245
translate chinese damanhur_march_day1_1ac9cf95:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你们刚离开达米埃塔，地平线上便出现了几队撒拉森斥候。他们紧盯着你们队伍的动向，如影随形，一路尾随。"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:247
translate chinese damanhur_march_day1_2981f552:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他们的持续出没让你始终摆脱不了危险的感觉。傍晚该停下来扎营过夜时，你几乎无法让自己合眼——尽管营地四周已布下众多哨兵。"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:249
translate chinese damanhur_march_day1_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:254
translate chinese damanhur_march_day1_07a7f8df:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}尽管危险感挥之不去，你还是决定打个盹，好让疲惫的身体稍作恢复。"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:256
translate chinese damanhur_march_day1_d14cd0c4:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}……"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:258
translate chinese damanhur_march_day1_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:263
translate chinese damanhur_march_day1_a1300b31:

    "{cps=50}一夜无事。"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:264
translate chinese damanhur_march_day1_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:268
translate chinese damanhur_march_day1_a90cb4ed:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}尽管白天的跋涉已让你疲惫至极，你仍整夜未合眼，随时准备击退撒拉森人可能的夜袭。"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:270
translate chinese damanhur_march_day1_e397d663:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}然而袭击终究没有发生。"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:272
translate chinese damanhur_march_day1_e2923e5e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}在艰苦跋涉之后又强撑一夜不眠，你的身体终究为此付出了代价。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}所有属性-2！"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:274
translate chinese damanhur_march_day1_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:286
translate chinese damanhur_march_day2_7ba6b4a2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}第二天的行程依旧是在沙漠中令人筋疲力尽的跋涉。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}疲劳增加！"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:289
translate chinese damanhur_march_day2_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:291
translate chinese damanhur_march_day2_dac13f58:

    "{cps=50}整整一天，你都在警惕地观察四周，却未发现任何可疑之处。许多同伴都松了一口气，认为被打退的撒拉森人再也不敢露面了。"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:292
translate chinese damanhur_march_day2_c4c231e5:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}但你并不像他们那样笃定，那份危险的感觉始终未曾消散。"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:294
translate chinese damanhur_march_day2_75788128:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}太阳落山时，又到了再次扎营过夜的时候……"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:296
translate chinese damanhur_march_day2_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:298
translate chinese damanhur_march_day2_7282ec28:

    "{cps=50}撒拉森骑手依旧远远地监视着你们——不敢贸然靠近，却也一刻都不曾从视野中消失。"

