# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:930
translate chinese damanhur_march_battle_intro_ebbdddf7:

    "{cps=50}第三天早晨，你环顾四周，再也看不到撒拉森人的踪影，这段时日以来一直纠缠着你的危险感，终于渐渐消散。"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:931
translate chinese damanhur_march_battle_intro_58baf5c1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}用过早餐，队伍精神饱满地踏上了行程——打起精神的士兵们哼起了歌，而你也发现，自己脸上难得地挂上了笑容。一切似乎并没有那么糟。"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:934
translate chinese damanhur_march_battle_intro_a32e773c:

    "{cps=50}到了第三天早上，你惊讶地发现，一路尾随你们的撒拉森人竟已消失得无影无踪。"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:935
translate chinese damanhur_march_battle_intro_a70cf99f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}起初，这让大家颇为欣喜。"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:938
translate chinese damanhur_march_battle_intro_7bb590b2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}然而几个小时后便显而易见，这份喜悦为时过早。{w}因为地平线上出现的并非孤零零的一小队斥候，而是一支气势逼人的撒拉森骑兵队伍，锁子甲在阳光下熠熠生辉。"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:940
translate chinese damanhur_march_battle_intro_a3b74249:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你们展开战斗队形，准备迎敌，但撒拉森人并不急于冲锋。他们反而停在弓箭射程之内，开始用箭矢和弩箭朝你们倾泻。"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:942
translate chinese damanhur_under_fire_76b2fe88_8:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:948
translate chinese damanhur_under_fire_07c1ff67:

    "{cps=50}几支箭射中了你，却被护甲叮当弹开。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}护甲覆盖、幸运——成功！"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:951
translate chinese damanhur_under_fire_4ca8db89:

    "{cps=50}几支箭射中了你，造成重伤。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}护甲覆盖、幸运——失败！{vspace=5}生命值减少25！{vspace=5}生命值：[player_health]/[player_health_max]"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:954
translate chinese damanhur_under_fire_735dbe23:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}其中一箭正中要害。"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:960
translate chinese damanhur_under_fire_76b2fe88:

