# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:1219
translate chinese damanhur_under_fire_hub_e5647d15:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}尽管箭雨密集，率领队伍的巴约的雷蒙德却严禁任何人脱离紧密的队形，唯恐中了撒拉森人的圈套……"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:1221
translate chinese damanhur_under_fire_hub_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:1223
translate chinese damanhur_under_fire_hub_0395c4a3:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}眼见无法诱使你们散开阵型出击，撒拉森弓箭手便后撤退让，换上一批重装战士，由他们亲自向你们的阵线发起进攻。"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:1225
translate chinese damanhur_under_fire_hub_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:1231
translate chinese damanhur_under_fire_hub_d0686e7b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你不愿让撒拉森人就这么舒舒服服地射杀你和同伴，于是擅自带人发起冲锋，径直扑向敌人。"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:1233
translate chinese damanhur_under_fire_hub_ae561259:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}一交手你便明白，自己抛下阵型贸然前冲，正好落入撒拉森人的圈套，转眼就要被团团包围……"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:1235
translate chinese damanhur_under_fire_hub_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:1241
translate chinese damanhur_under_fire_hub_9233f1cc:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你咬紧牙关，顶着箭雨继续坚守阵地。{vspace=5}与此同时，撒拉森弓箭手又向天空放出新一波箭矢……"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:1243
translate chinese damanhur_under_fire_hub_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:1624
translate chinese damanhur_march_attack_battle_fight_342ac00e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你拼死搏杀，总算在陷阱彻底合拢之前杀出重围，安然退回本阵。"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:1626
translate chinese damanhur_march_attack_battle_fight_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:1632
translate chinese damanhur_march_attack_battle_fight_05b02d46:

    "{cps=50}包围圈正在缓缓收拢。你眼看就要被彻底合围……"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:1634
translate chinese damanhur_march_attack_battle_fight_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:1649
translate chinese damanhur_march_attack_battle_fight_8faf01d8:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}撒拉森人成功将你们与身后的大队人马隔开，随后毫不费力地把你们一个接一个地尽数斩杀。"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:1651
translate chinese damanhur_march_attack_battle_fight_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:1728
translate chinese damanhur_march_attack_battle_postfight_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:2110
translate chinese damanhur_march_defend_battle_fight_b4551df1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你顶住了敌人的攻势，逼得他们狼狈溃退。"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:2112
translate chinese damanhur_march_defend_battle_fight_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:2191
translate chinese damanhur_march_defend_battle_postfight_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:2198
translate chinese damanhur_siege_3d18ac9a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}眼见撒拉森人如今已陷入不利境地，雷蒙德当即决定发起反击。"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:2200
translate chinese damanhur_siege_35550634:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}被打了个措手不及的敌人溃散奔逃。一刻钟后，那支声势浩大的撒拉森队伍便再无踪迹。"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:2202
translate chinese damanhur_siege_f4fc3cd4:

    nvl clear
    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}尽管战斗以一场干脆的胜利告终，你对这次行动成功的信心却越来越低。离开达米埃塔不过数日，连达曼胡尔的城墙都还没望见，队伍就已折损了近四分之一的战士。"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:2206
translate chinese damanhur_siege_7570b00c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}再与撒拉森人打一场这样的遭遇战，攻下达曼胡尔的希望就要彻底葬送——因为届时将无人可用来攻打城墙了。"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:2208
translate chinese damanhur_siege_a0d4c6fd:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}所幸，给予撒拉森人的这场败仗足够沉重，为你们余下的行程扫清了威胁。又经过数日艰苦跋涉，你们终于抵达了目的地。"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:2210
translate chinese damanhur_siege_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:2217
translate chinese damanhur_siege_b3e9906f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}坐落在绿洲之畔的达曼胡尔是一座规模宏大的城市，城防坚固，论难以攻取，几乎不逊于达米埃塔的堡垒。"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:2219
translate chinese damanhur_siege_8aba3044:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}以一名老练战士的目光，你一眼便看出，你们这点兵力根本不足以围城合围——达曼胡尔实在太过庞大。"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:2221
translate chinese damanhur_siege_d5185ac3:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}在军事会议上陈述了你的考量之后，你说服了雷蒙德：夺取此城的唯一机会便是以迅雷之势发动突袭。否则，每拖延一天，从四面八方得到增援的守军就会更强，而你们这支既无援兵、又易遭袭扰的孤军，只会一天天消耗殆尽。"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:2223
translate chinese damanhur_siege_530dfc8a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}雷蒙德给了部下们一周时间休整备战，随后定下了攻城之议。"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:2225
translate chinese damanhur_siege_e89bf60e:

    nvl clear
    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}接下来的一周在紧锣密鼓的备战中度过，主要工作便是从附近的绿洲取来木料，打造一座巨大的攻城塔。"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:2229
translate chinese damanhur_siege_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:2239
translate chinese damanhur_siege_3aee8191:

    "{cps=50}你的工匠手艺正好派上用场——由你亲自督导，这座攻城塔造得坚固而可靠。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}工艺、行囊中的材料——成功！"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:2242
translate chinese damanhur_siege_42a98b3f:

    "{cps=50}可惜的是，队伍里并无真正能干的工匠，能将这座塔的建造安排得井井有条。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}工艺、行囊中的材料——失败！"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:2243
translate chinese damanhur_siege_99c294b6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}于是，本应坚固可靠的攻城器械，只能将就着用眼前这堆歪歪扭扭、质量堪忧的构架。"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:2248
translate chinese damanhur_siege_ae396944:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}到了定下的日子，听取最后的部署后，你们登上攻城塔，缓缓向城墙推进。"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:2250
translate chinese damanhur_siege_7a794ee6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}要想成功突入城中，必须拔除守军的四个关键支撑点——四座防守严密的巨型堡垒。"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:2252
translate chinese damanhur_siege_3ebf1dd9:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}攻城塔刚一靠近城墙，密集的箭矢与石块便铺天盖地砸来。"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:2254
translate chinese damanhur_siege_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:2258
translate chinese damanhur_siege_1f6f8285:

    "{cps=50}然而塔身结构坚固，牢牢护住了你与同伴们，挡下了所有攻击。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}塔身结构——成功！{vspace=5}突击队无一伤亡！{vspace=5}突击队人数：[damanhur_siege_attack_party]"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:2261
translate chinese damanhur_siege_960c8d81:

    "{cps=50}起初攻城塔尚能抵挡，但不久之后，其结构的脆弱便显露无遗——穿入塔内的石块与箭矢杀伤了不少战士。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}塔身结构——失败！{vspace=5}突击队人数减少5！{vspace=5}突击队人数：[damanhur_siege_attack_party]"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:2263
translate chinese damanhur_siege_d3354726:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}终于抵达城墙之下，你们离开攻城塔，与守城士兵展开厮杀……"

# game/script_dlc_1.rpy:2265
